nDig through the ground to trap your pursuers, climb to escape them, and grab every skull scattered through the maze. Once the last skull is collected, a hidden exit appears somewhere in the labyrinth. Find it before the enemies find you \u2014 because they want their skulls back.\n\nFeatures:\n- Build your own levels in a fast, intuitive VR editor\n- Multiple ready-made levels to play right away\n- Vertical labyrinths with ladders, bars, and diggable floors\n- Trap enemies by collapsing the ground beneath them\n- Atmospheric horror: dim light, tense sound, and relentless pursuit", "short_description": "A horror arcade where YOU build the nightmare. Design claustrophobic multi-level labyrinths, then survive them: towering walls, dim light, unsettling sounds, and relentless pursuers. Collect every skull and escape - if you can."}]}, "developer_name": "NIKOVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nikovr.com/privacy/deadfall-runner", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NIKOVR", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/6Te6gfYx6q", "website_url": "https://nikovr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1091853357034862"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2026126028053324"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1495132342539